{"about_the_game":"Idle Atomic is an Incremental Idle RPG in a post-apocalyptic world.<br><br>You stand alone in the wasteland and must fight monsters, salvage resources and refine materials to survive! <br><br>Key features:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/d367e13969dcd4712bcea0f66a8b5b32.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" width=608 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/d367e13969dcd4712bcea0f66a8b5b32.webm?t=1709315211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>- Defeat monsters, gain power, unlock new zones and hunt down bounties!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/b16d9708189d8e859ce5ac5ccd6b87c0.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/b16d9708189d8e859ce5ac5ccd6b87c0.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=110 /></picture></span><br>- Gather a large variety of loot and discover rare salvaging spawns!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/16521db5a4ab355aafa162813fa3e139.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/16521db5a4ab355aafa162813fa3e139.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=110 /></picture></span><br>- Use resources gathered to refine materials, craft permanent power-ups and suit upgrades, enhance item efficiency and more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1